# Repository-level ignores.
#
# The Unity project keeps its own rules in Sahkku/.gitignore (the stock Unity template),
# which covers Library/, Temp/, Logs/, UserSettings/ and the generated *.csproj / *.sln
# files inside Sahkku/. Only things that live outside that project belong here.

# Agent / tool session state.
.reasonix
.reasonix/
reasonix.toml
.pairflow/

# Build output of the .NET tooling, i.e. the headless rules tests in Tools/RulesTests
# (`dotnet test Tools/RulesTests`).
Tools/**/bin/
Tools/**/obj/

# Node tooling for the TypeScript rules core: dependencies and test output.
node_modules/
coverage/

# Static bundle produced by the 2D web client (`npm run build`).
dist/

# Editor and OS cruft.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
